@prefix am: <http://example.org/awareness-manager#> .


# What the robot can do. The awareness manager derives one action per thing that is an instance
# of EVERY appliesTo class (subclasses included) and sees nothing about an action beyond these fields.
# How to carry an action out is the executor's business.

am:inspect a am:ActionType ;
    am:appliesTo     am:Place ;                 # look at the place: a table or sink is not a container
    am:observesClaim "present" ;
    am:duration      5 .                        # seconds at the target. Chosen: hand-set
